{"id":"vod_sn_39262","vodId":"39262","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"笨女孩","name_cn":"笨女孩","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/306f1a0411002f05a9e578f954c12cbf.jpg"},"summary":"花畑佳子（悠木碧 配音）是一个实实在在的笨蛋。不仅学习力为零，常常收获零分的考卷，在生活中，也是个完全不认路，总是莫名其妙惹出各种各样麻烦的问题人物。可是，佳子虽然脑袋笨，却拥有一颗闪闪发光的善良的内心。阿久津明（杉田智和 配音）和佳子刚好相反，他拥有绝顶聪明的头脑，却不擅长一切和运动有关的事情。是他一直陪伴在佳子身边，照顾着她的学习和生活。　　温柔迷糊的隅野沙耶香（原田彩枫 配音）是佳子唯一的也是最好的朋友，她的言行举止常常在不知不觉之中被佳子带歪。风纪委员长（上坂堇 配音）苦苦的暗恋着津明，佳子对于她来说，是情敌一般的存在。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/MR53mejJs51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mJVj7piJKV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/3AncWrX0WP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ckU9EY2Dhm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q3ijTx7TW51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/mCCrWBAKDP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/wB8y5NZu6z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/nd20fve8Pr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/2mt4mwwLex1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/8GqQBjzbyX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xfG4Ld2k9i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/nfMjtV3Qcv1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:48.653Z"}